        }
      ],
      "reports": []
    },
    {
      "evidenceId": "evidence:eintrag",
      "text": "Below the names of the evening's guests there is one last entry, in hurried handwriting: “21:40, Tobias Wenger, winter room, ski tour to the glacier.” So he was in the hut tonight, even though no one saw him at dinner.",
      "mentions": [
