    {
      "evidenceId": "evidence:funkprotokoll",
      "text": "The radio shows the last connection: 23:05 to 23:15, Mountain Rescue Valley. Lukas Brandl reports the weather conditions; from 23:08 Dr. Johanna Pichler talks about a patient. Both voices can be heard the whole time.",
